Changes made by PromBoard in nodes/seedvr2_core:
- removed the ComfyUI node code (src/interfaces) and the model downloader (src/utils/downloads.py)
- removed the OmegaConf "eval" resolver and wrote the computed values into configs_3b/main.yaml and configs_7b/main.yaml
- config "__object__" paths only resolve to the registered model classes (no dynamic import)
- the 3B/7B config is chosen from the checkpoint file name only
- the text embedding paths (pos_emb.pt / neg_emb.pt) are set by the plugin
- reworded the "pip install ..." hints inside error messages

Model weights are not included. The plugin downloads them at prepare time from
ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR2-3B, numz/SeedVR2_comfyUI and AInVFX/SeedVR2_comfyUI on Hugging Face
(all Apache License 2.0).
